('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_515','nourishment','''nɝɪʃmənt','''nʌrɪʃm(ə)nt','[n] 食物','His favorite fruits and vegetables as well as 55 lb. of bamboo will be on board for nourishment.  除了它最喜爱的水果和蔬菜以外还有55磅的竹子将会作为它在飞机上的食物。'),
