('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_522','nucleus','''nuklɪəs','''njuːklɪəs','[n] 核心；原子核','Neutrons and protons are bound together in the nucleus of an atom.  在一个原子的核内，中子和质子聚合在一起。'),
