('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_528','numerical','nʊ''mɛrɪkl','njuː''merɪk(ə)l','[adj] 数字的，用数字表示的','a numerical code  数字密码'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_529','numerous','''numərəs','''njuːm(ə)rəs','[adj] 许许多多的','Numerous attempts have been made to hide the truth.  为掩盖事实作了很多尝试。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_530','nursery','''nɝsəri','''nɜːs(ə)rɪ','[n] 保育室，托儿所','He has painted murals in his children''s nursery.  他在他家的育儿室画上了壁画。'),
