('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_570','paranoia',',pærə''nɔɪə',',pærə''nɒɪə','[n] 偏执狂；妄想狂','They capitalize on panic and paranoia.  他们利用恐慌和偏执狂。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_571','paraphernalia','''pærəfə''nelɪə',',pærəfə''neɪlɪə','[n] 随身用品；贴身用品','...a large courtyard full of builders'' paraphernalia.  …一个充满建筑装备的大院子'),
