('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_574','parliament','''pɑrləmənt','''pɑːləm(ə)nt','[n] 议会，国会','They demanded a free parliament and press.  他们要求议会自由和新闻自由。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_575','parody','''pærədi','''pærədɪ','[n] 模仿，拙劣的模仿','Her performance contains a strong element of self-parody (= when someone makes fun of their own style ) .  她的表演包含了强烈的自嘲元素。'),
