('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_784','subsequent','''sʌbsɪkwənt','''sʌbsɪkw(ə)nt','[adj] 接着的，然后的','These skills were passed on to subsequent generations.  这些技能代代相传。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_785','subside','səb''saɪd','səb''saɪd','[v] 洪水退落；土地下沉；建筑物沉降','After the heavy rains, part of the road subsided.  大雨过后，部分路面塌陷了。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_786','subsidiary','səb''sɪdɪɛri','səb''sɪdɪərɪ','[adj] 辅助的；附属的; [n] 子公司，附属机构','a subsidiary hypothesis  一个附带假设'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_787','subsidy','''sʌbsədi','''sʌbsɪdɪ','[n] 补助金；津贴费','European farmers are planning a massive demonstration against farm subsidy cuts.  欧洲的农场主们正在策划一场反对削减农场补贴的大游行。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_788','symposium','sɪm''pozɪəm','sɪm''pəʊzɪəm','[n] 专题论文集，讨论会','He had been taking part in an international symposium on population.  他那时在参加一个有关人口的国际研讨会。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_789','symptom','''sɪmptəm','''sɪm(p)təm','[n] 症状，症候，征兆','One of the most common symptoms of schizophrenia is hearing imaginary voices.  精神分裂症最常见的症状之一是幻听。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_790','synchronize','''sɪŋkrənaɪz','''siŋkrənaiz','[v] 使同时发生，使同步发生','It was virtually impossible to synchronize our lives so as to take vacations and weekends together.  为了一起度假和过周末而要让我们的生活同步几乎是不可能的。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_791','synonym','ˈsɪnənɪm','''sɪnənɪm','[n] 同义词','The term "industrial democracy" is often used as a synonym for worker participation.  “工业民主”这一词语常被用作“工人参与”的同义词。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_792','synthesis','''sɪnθəsɪs','''sɪnθɪsɪs','[n] 合成法；综合，合成物','speech synthesis software  语音合成软件'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_793','synthetic','sɪn''θɛtɪk','sɪn''θetɪk','[adj] 人工合成的','synthetic chemicals  合成化学品'),
