('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_795','tablet','''tæblət','''tæblɪt','[n] 碑，书板；药片','She took a couple of headache tablets .  她吃了几片头痛药。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_796','taboo','tə''bu','tə''buː','[n] (宗教迷信)禁忌; [adj] 禁忌的，禁止的','The topic of addiction remains something of a taboo in our family.  毒瘾在我们家依然是个有些忌讳的话题。'),
