('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_831','traverse','trə''vɝs','''trævəs; trə''vɜːs','[v] 横越，穿过','two minutes to traverse the park  两分钟横穿公园'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_832','treatise','''tritɪs','''triːtɪs; -ɪz','[n] 专题论文','...Locke''s Treatise on Civil Government.  ...洛克的《政府论》。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_833','treatment','''tritmənt','''triːtm(ə)nt','[n] 对待，待遇；处理，治疗','Just lately, Kyra has been giving me the silent treatment (= refusing to speak to me because she is angry with me ) .  就在最近，凯拉一直对我不理不睬。'),
