('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_836','trek','trɛk','trek','[v] 长途跋涉；旅行','...trekking through the jungles.  …徒步穿越丛林。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_837','tremble','''trɛmbl','''tremb(ə)l','[vi&n] 发抖，震颤','His lip started to tremble and then he started to cry.  他的嘴唇开始颤抖，接着就哭了起来。'),
