('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_839','trench','trɛntʃ','tren(t)ʃ','[n] 地沟','Workers dug a trench for gas lines.  工人们挖了一条沟来铺设煤气管道。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_840','trend','trɛnd','trend','[n] 倾向，趋势','The current trend is towards more part-time employment.  当前的趋势是雇用更多的兼职人员。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_841','trespass','''trɛspəs','''trespəs','[v] 非法侵入；侵夺，侵占','Stephen Leckar has 30 minutes to represent Jones, and he tries to advance a second argument in this case: The very act of installing the GPS device on a private vehicle constitutes a trespass.  琼斯的律师斯蒂文·莱卡有30分钟时间替琼斯辩护，他又提出了一个新论点：警方在琼斯私人汽车上装跟踪器的做法本身构成“非法入侵”。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_842','trial','''traɪəl','''traɪəl','[n] 试验；试用；审讯，受审','The trial is due to start next week.  审理定于下周开始。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_843','triangle','''traɪæŋɡl','''traɪæŋg(ə)l','[n] 三角，三角形；三角关系','a triangle of land  一块三角地'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_844','tributary','''trɪbjə''tɛri','''trɪbjʊt(ə)rɪ','[n&a] 支流(的)','...the Napo river, a tributary of the Amazon.  ...纳波河，亚马孙河的一条支流。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_845','trick','trɪk','trɪk','[n] 诡计；恶作剧；技艺','Pretending he doesn’t remember is an old trick of his.  假装不记得是他的老花招了。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_846','trickle','''trɪkl','''trɪk(ə)l','[v&n] (使)滴流，(使)细流','The water in the stream had been reduced to a trickle.  小溪里的水已只剩下一股细流。'),
