('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_1118','endorse','ɪn''dɔrs','ɪn''dɔːs; en-','[v] 背书，签署(姓名)，赞同','I can endorse their opinion wholeheartedly.  我可以全心全意地支持他们的观点。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_1119','endow','ɪn''daʊ','ɪn''daʊ; en-','[v] 捐款，资助','The ambassador has endowed a $1 million public-service fellowships programme.  大使资助了一个100万美元的公共服务奖学金项目。'),
