('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_1125','engrave','ɪn''ɡrev','ɪn''greɪv; en-','[v] 刻上；铭记','Your wedding ring can be engraved with a personal inscription at no extra cost.  你的结婚戒指可以刻上个人题字不另收费。'),
