('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2334','psychology','saɪ''kɑlədʒi','saɪ''kɒlədʒɪ','[n] 心理学','I understood the psychology of this, but it still hurt.  我理解这种心理，但这仍然让我感到伤心。'),
