('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2356','reckon','''rɛkən','''rek(ə)n','[v] 计算','The expression ‘full moon’ means the fourteenth day of the moon reckoned from its first appearance.  所谓“满月”是指从新月初现算起的第14天。'),
