('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2510','toneless','''tonləs','''təʊnlɪs','[adj] 单调的，沉闷的','‘I’m sorry,’ he said, in a flat toneless voice.  “对不起。”他以淡淡的声调说道。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2511','tongue','tʌŋ','tʌŋ','[n] 舌头；语言；舌状物（火舌）','Joe ran his tongue over his dry lips.  乔舔了舔干燥的嘴唇。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2512','tonic','''tɑnɪk','''tɒnɪk','[n&a] 滋补品，补药；强身的，健体的','A lot of people need a tonic at the end of the winter.  很多人冬末需要进补。'),
