('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2545','unconscious','ʌn''kɑnʃəs','ʌn''kɒnʃəs','[adj] 无畏的，大胆的','She was found alive but unconscious.  她被找到时还活着，但已不省人事。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2546','verge','vɝdʒ','vɜːdʒ','[n] 边缘，边界','The car skidded across the road and came to a stop on the grass verge.  汽车滑过路面，在路缘草带上停了下来。'),
