('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_2843','erupt','ɪ''rʌpt','ɪ''rʌpt','[v] 喷发，爆发','Violence erupted after police shot a student during the demonstration.  警察向示威人群中的一名学生开枪，暴乱随之发生。'),
