('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_3365','tragedy','''trædʒədi','''trædʒɪdɪ','[n] 悲剧；惨事','The tragedy happened as they were returning home from a night out.  悲剧发生在他们夜里外出归来的路上。'),
('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_3366','trail','trel','treɪl','[n] 痕迹，足迹，小径; [v] 拖，拉，蔓延','The trail led over Boulder Pass before descending to a lake.  小路越过博尔德山口，然后向下通往湖边。'),
