('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_3399','uniform','''junɪfɔrm','''juːnɪfɔːm','[adj] 不变的，一贯的; [n] 制服','Grade A eggs must be of uniform size.  A 级鸡蛋必须大小相同。'),
