('IELTS_2','IELTS_2_3427','waggon','''wægən','''wæɡən','[n] 货车','The ragged man drags a waggon of rag fragments.  那个衣衫褴褛的人拉著一货车破布碎片.'),
('KaoYan_3','KaoYan_3_1','cancel','''kænsl','''kænsl','[vi] 相互抵消; [vt] 取消；删去， 划掉； 把…作废','Our flight was cancelled.  我们的航班取消了。'),
