('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3051','formaldehyde','fɔr''mældɪhaɪd','fɔː''mældɪhaɪd','[n] 蚁醛，[有化] 甲醛','frogs preserved in formaldehyde  保存在甲醛中的青蛙'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3052','ilmenite','''ɪlmənaɪt','''ɪlmənaɪt','[n] [矿物] 钛铁矿','Future miners living and working on the Moon could break down ilmenite to liberate these elements.  未来在月球上生活和工作的矿工们可能会分解钛铁矿从而释放出其所含的这些元素。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3053','ion','''aɪən','''aɪən','[n] [化学] 离子','These vibrations turn the ion into a sort of superfast metronome.  铝离子因为这些振动成为一种超高速节拍器。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3054','Kelvin','''kɛlvɪn','''kelvɪn','[n] 绝对温标；凯尔文（男子名）；[热] 开尔文（英国物理学家，数学家）; [adj] 开氏度的（常作K-）','He knew he had found Lord Kelvin’s unknown source of heat.  他知道他发现了开尔文勋爵所说的来源不明的热量。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3055','morphogenetic','','','[adj] 有关形态发生的；地貌成因的','There, scientists have been manipulating the levels of bone-morphogenetic protein or BMP in the brains of laboratory mice.  在那里，科学家已经成功操纵了小白鼠大脑中的骨形态发生蛋白（或称BMP）的水平。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3056','muon','''mjʊ,ɑn','''mjuːɒn','[n] [高能] μ介子','The team prepares a beam of just one type, muon neutrinos, sending them from Cern to an underground laboratory at Gran Sasso in Italy to see how many show up as a different type, tau neutrinos.  这个小组准备了一束单一类别的中微子即μ介子中微子并将它们由研究所射向位于意大利Gran Sasso地下的实验室来观察有多少变换了种类，τ介子中微子。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3057','neutrino','nu''trino','njuː''triːnəʊ','[n] 【核物理学】中微子','When a neutron inside an atom decays, it produces a proton, an electron, and a neutrino.  原子内的一个中子衰变后会产生一个质子、一个电子和一个中微子。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3058','nucleons','''nʊklɪɑn','''njuːklɪɒn','[n] [高能] 核子','They are immune to the nuclear force that strongly influences nucleons .  强烈影响核子的核力对电子是没有作用的。'),
