('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3060','plutonium','plu''tonɪəm','pluː''təʊnɪəm','[n] [化学] 钚（94号元素）','What about plutonium in the drinking water?  钚会不会存在于饮用水里呢？'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3061','potassium','pə''tæsɪəm','pə''tæsɪəm','[n] [化学] 钾','I let the silver nitrate react with pieces of brain hardened in potassium dichromate.  我让已被重铬酸钾硬化的一些脑组织细胞与硝酸银反应。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3062','protons','','','[n] [物] 质子；氢核（proton的复数）','We cannot do anything about protons, they are buried in the nucleus, but we can add or subtract electrons.  我们不能改变质子，它们埋藏在原子核内，但是我们能够增加或减少电子。'),
('GMAT_2','GMAT_2_3063','radiometric','','','[adj] 放射性测量的；辐射度的；辐射测量的',''),
