('Level8_2','Level8_2_700','asymmetric',',esɪ''mɛtrɪk',',æsɪ''metrɪk','[adj] 不对称的；非对称的','Well, unless you have an asymmetric set-up, in which case the client can POST and/or PUT its order somewhere on the server.  那么，除非你有一个不对称的设置，在这种情况下，客户端可以POST和/或PUT它的订单到服务器的某处。'),
